Scope of this license
=======================

The MIT license text below applies **only** to the HowLongToBeat (HLTB)
interoperability materials in **this same directory** (this folder and its
contents), namely:

- `HltbCacheFileAccess.cs` — shared-read access to HLTB per-game cache JSON on disk.
- `HltbInteriorLabelOverlap.cs` — overlap suppression for interior HLTB time labels.
- `HltbPlaytimeFormat.cs` — playtime label formatting aligned with Playnite / HLTB.
- `HltbSettingsJson.cs` — merges HLTB settings from Playnite JSON into render options.
- `HltbSortKeyBuilder.cs` — builds HLTB column sort keys from cached times and settings.
- `HowLongToBeatAddonNavigation.cs` — detects HLTB add-on install/enable state and opens
  Playnite's Add-ons UI for HowLongToBeat.
- `HowLongToBeatCache.cs` — reads the official HLTB Playnite extension's on-disk cache
  and settings for rendering.
- `HowLongToBeatCachedProgressBar.cs` — list-view bar UI driven by that data.
- `HowLongToBeatPluginButtonHost.cs` — optional embedding of the HLTB extension's small
  game view control.
- `NOTICE.md` — attribution and provenance notes for the above.

It does **not** apply to the Playlist extension as a whole. The rest of the
repository is licensed under the terms stated in the **repository root**
`LICENSE` file (unless another file in a given path states otherwise).

The upstream HowLongToBeat plugin project (Lacro59) is MIT-licensed; the MIT
text below is the standard license from that upstream work. This folder's
disclaimer clarifies that our Playlist project is not relicensing unrelated code
under MIT.

